# CELL009 (15-95% SoC, 25 degC, 103 kPa) partial-window setting, adopted 2026-10-01
# (run P3a_ref_CELL009_crack1.1e4_w1e-3). Use ON TOP of crack_baseline_v3.env:
#   python rpt_soc_plots.py 25p1595 --aligned   with these exported (RPT_C64_WIDTH
#   overrides the 25 degC config's width).
# CELL009-specific deviations from the shared 25/45 degC set (see FINDINGS.md):
#   cathode LAM x0.3   -- real cathode LAM plateaus at ~4-5%; the model's stress law grows ~linearly
#   Si crack mult 1.1e4 (shared 1e3) -- stand-in for volume-change-driven cracking
#                        (PROPOSAL_strain_driven_cracking.md)
#   width 1e-3 (25 degC shared 5e-3) -- delays the k/expansion transition towards the data
# The conditioned RPT1 reference (aligned_rpt_cycling.py, partial windows) is part of this setting.
C64_POS_LAM_MULT=0.3
C64_SI_CRACK_MULT=1.1e4
RPT_C64_WIDTH=1e-3
